### Production Considerations
- **State Management**: Proper serialization and persistence of agent states
- **Error Recovery**: Robust error handling with multiple recovery strategies
- **Performance**: Efficient graph operations and state updates
- **Scalability**: Distributed execution and checkpointing
- **Monitoring**: Comprehensive metrics and observability

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid
- ❌ Storing sensitive data in agent state without encryption
- ❌ Not implementing proper checkpointing for long-running workflows
- ❌ No error recovery mechanisms for agent failures
- ❌ Blocking operations in agent nodes
- ❌ Not validating state transitions

### Quality Gates
- [ ] State serialization and persistence working
- [ ] Error recovery mechanisms implemented
- [ ] Performance monitoring active
- [ ] Checkpointing system operational
- [ ] Graph updates synchronized in real-time
- [ ] Workflow validation implemented
- [ ] Recovery strategies tested
- [ ] Monitoring integration complete